+## 2026-11-06: 0213 combined NV12 CPU fallback prepared and locally checked
+- Reviewed saved active sunfish frontend CPU fallback (phone/metal2/NativeBridgeMetalFrontend.mm, snapshot 2026-11-05). Chose owned RGBA conversion for combined Metal format500 rather than assuming native multi-plane support in the pinned Mesa. Supports format520 sRGB per primary WebKit enum; deliberately does not mislabel format501 (422) as sRGB.
+- New checked converter: only 8-bit NV12 420v/420f, validates both plane rows/dimensions/allocation bounds, 64 MiB output cap, odd dimensions supported when chroma covers them. Video/full range and BT.601/709/2020 coefficients; honors recognized IOSurface matrix metadata, defaults BT.601 only when absent, rejects unknown string matrices. Source pixels read under IOSurfaceLockReadOnly and never modified.
+- Combined input creates an owned sampled RGBA texture; refreshes on source seed changes at the normal mesaTexture getter before binding. Scratch reused and freed on texture destruction. Actual render-target use returns NULL explicitly; no unsupported NV12 GPU writeback is silently discarded. Shader-write requests refused. Ordinary BGRA path retained.
+- Local actual-converter tests pass against independent floating-point colour equations, neutral video black/white, padding/odd sizes, truncated buffers and overflow. Existing plane-import tests pass. Pinned donor transform verifies constructor, refresh hook, render-target guard, bounded logs and cleanup. Local ASan library unavailable; sanitizer check added to macOS CI instead, not claimed passed locally.
+- Native synthetic helper on current phone confirms read-only IOSurface lock and unlock both return0, rows still64/64; helper removed. First automatic approval review timed out before execution; one permitted retry succeeded. No other device changes since rollback.
+- Official Mesa archive fetch timed out; incomplete bytes renamed .partial, not checksum-verified or used as evidence. Current phone remains kernel0211 + original graphics bundle, Bluetooth audio working per USER. Full 0213 native build/device test still pending.
+
 ## 2026-11-06: 0212 installed/tested then original bundle restored; combined YUV blocker confirmed
 - Native Metal CI 42205828792 SUCCESS; source 89b4f2126e983d95b56f0f6b46600ff76d126a3a. All 6 legacy artifact file hashes and ARM64 Mach-O headers verified. Update tar SHA256 c161c79a4b048112b9d9e692cb381924257dce6ae1ee312d5a0494ba87426c77. Staging hashes passed on phone; prior installed bundle matched host backup before activation.
 - Activated staged bundle with original preserved, restarted compositor; normal UI rendering/async completion observed, no graphics crash. Media/audio/Wi-Fi daemons left running. However USER video still dark with Bluetooth audio; reported blurred app-switcher previews.
